Port of _patches/typescript/025-tsoptions-tsconfigparsing.patch (tsc/internal/tsoptions/tsconfigparsing.go) to tsrs.

- The three mergeParsedCompilerOptions calls (extended config, own config, existing options) pass the source config
  path and base path to merge_compiler_options (patch 013), with Go's arguments.
- ValidateCompilerOptionsCallback / RegisterValidateCompilerOptionsCallback:
  tsrs_tsoptions::{ValidateCompilerOptionsCallback, register_validate_compiler_options_callback} (an Arc'd closure
  behind a process-wide RwLock, as patch 002's callback). parse_json_config_file_content_worker appends its
  diagnostics after the project references are read and before the file names are computed, as Go does. Go's
  `*core.CompilerOptions` and `*ast.SourceFile` (both may be nil) are `Option`s.

